  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v5.3.4: on SpawnDev.ILGPU 5.3.5 + SpawnDev.SpawnJS 3.0.1. GPU face decode + weighted NMS (FaceDetectionPipeline reads back 18 floats a face, not 61 KB); compile-time constant folding broadcasts per axis (N-D); 2-D ConvTranspose honours output_padding; ML_SHAPE_TRACE diagnostic - big-LaMa now matches onnxruntime. v5.3.3: on SpawnDev.ILGPU 5.3.3 (CreateScan(Exclusive) fixed on WebGPU and Wasm past one workgroup-sized chunk) + SpawnDev.SpawnJS 3.0.1. No ML code change. 5.3.2: Video Depth Anything streaming, FP16-stored weights at full speed, WeightStorage.Half. See CHANGELOG.md.",
